      "content": "okay i think i get the gist. but \"unaided memory\" sounds a bit vague to me. like, if i remember a specific way to optimize a database query or a particular logic flow i used for them, does that count as a \"residual\"? i don't want them coming after me later for using a pattern i learned while on their clock.",
